A beautiful Social Media and RSS widget with Facebook Like Box, Twitter, Google +1 and RSS with Thumbnails.

== Description ==

Adds a social widget for your social media accounts.

1. Supports Facebook, Twitter, Google +1 button
1. Supports External RSS Feed with thumbnails.
1. Option to chooce if the widget will appear on home page, categories, etc.

Visit our Website for more: (http://www.seofixing.com/ "WP Fixes & Updates")

== Installation ==

Copy the directory 'go-multiwidget' to your WordPress '/wp-content/plugins' folder.

1. Activate the 'Go MultiWidget+' plugin in your WordPress admin 'Plugins'
2. Add the 'Go MultiWidget' to the sidebar from the widget menu
3. Configure
4. Done


== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= How to Add the Facebook Page =

Add the Link to the Facebook page
ex. http://www.facebook.com/seofixing

= How to Add Twitter =

Add the Twitter Account Name without the @

= How to Add Google+ =

Add your Google Page ID
ex. +seofixing

= How to Add RSS Feed =

Add the RSS Url
ex. http://www.seofixing.com/feed
Be sure the selected feed has images included for the thumbnails to appear.


